menu "TriageBox debug"

    config TB_DEBUG_CONSOLE
        bool "Enable serial debug console (frame injection + stats)"
        default n
        help
            Adds rfid/vital/status/btn/stats commands over USB Serial/JTAG so the
            triage flow can be demoed and profiled without the STM32 attached.

            Keep this OFF for anything a patient touches: it lets anyone connected
            over USB fake vital signs and drive the UI.

endmenu
